"stop_ts":1795239110,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"mv557946":{"show_id":"mv557946","tmdb_id":557946,"content_type":"movie","title":"Last Looks","title_en":null,"title_fr":"Waldo, détective privé","original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"ينتقل شرطي سابق مهان إلى الغابة ليعيش وحيدا، لكن سرعان ما تقاطع حياته الهادئة عندما يوظفه محقق خاص للبحث في جريمة قتل.","description_en":"A disgraced ex-cop seeks solace by moving to the woods, but his quiet life comes to an end when a private eye recruits him to investigate the murder of an eccentric TV star's wife.","description_fr":"Charlie Waldo s’est fait virer avec perte et fracas de la police de Los Angeles. Il mène depuis une existence paisible au fin fond des bois, loin du monde. Sa vie solitaire s’achève lorsqu’un détective privé l’engage pour l’aider à enquêter sur le meurtre de l’épouse d’une vedette d’une série TV judiciaire. C’est, pour Charlie Waldo, un retour choc dans le monde d’Hollywood, avec ses intrigues de couloirs, ses relations sulfureuses et ses stars capricieuses. Bienvenue en enfer !","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud0XdA2xAghDR66j3I84DnNlC2g.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6uKXrsdguwZrtG5BL1wBHvxWs3Z.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.8,"vote_count":402,"age_rating":"R","year":"2022","release_date":"2022-01-27","runtime_minutes":110,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حركة","جريمة","إثارة","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["action","crime","thriller"],"similar":["mv603692","mv11636","mv923667","mv534490","mv522931","mv2207","mv27582","mv645788"],"director":"Tim Kirkby","cast":[{"name":"تشارلي هونام","character":"Charlie Waldo","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5WIDrnY25Ps2RYu0zIzHSVuSt5n.jpg"},{"name":"Mel Gibson","character":"Alastair Pinch","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jnqHMaOslt8cef2atSmOpGRvNla.jpg"},{"name":"Morena Baccarin","character":"Lorena","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1