eve they solved years ago; is there a serial killer on the loose, and did they perhaps put the wrong person behind bars?","description_fr":"Après avoir passé trente ans ensemble dans la police de New York, les détectives Turk et Rooster sont prêts à tout, sauf à prendre leur retraite. Peu avant leur départ, plusieurs criminels ayant échappé à la justice sont assassinés selon un mode opératoire qui rappelle celui d'un serial-killer que les deux enquêteurs ont mis sous les verrous plusieurs années auparavant. Une insupportable question se pose alors : Turk et Rooster se seraient-ils trompés ? C'est le début d'une enquête à hauts risques...","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKL5pzUfGOqOFjf0VN47nXlZOAL.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/29zDvVtGcJSzGTocSHqHDSNCQMW.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.9,"vote_count":1426,"age_rating":"R","year":"2008","release_date":"2008-09-11","runtime_minutes":101,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["جريمة","إثارة","غموض","دراما"],"genre_keys":["crime","thriller","mystery","drama"],"similar":["mv1949","mv567","mv11324","mv637649","mv338766","mv11636","mv392572","mv446791"],"director":"Jon Avnet","cast":[{"name":"روبرت دي نيرو","character":"Turk","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cT8htcckIuyI1Lqwt1CvD02ynTh.jpg"},{"name":"آل باتشينو","character":"Rooster","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m8HAAjq1T75JypKk0v1FFQn4ysZ.jpg"},{"name":"٥٠ سنت","character":"Spider","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7VfwFIwBxy7qBUErosWRDQOovl9.jpg"},{"name":"كارلا جوجينو","character":"Karen Corelli","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dAqGOsHSzlP6RhaUURX2NrwITaq.jpg"},{"name":"جون ليجويزامو","character":"Det. Simon Perez","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kwYCdxTlDh9zauUCg4mp2XTCQTw.jpg"},{"name":"دوني والبيرغ","character":"Det. Ted Riley","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8OQTlgl7eGAFlKTF2o8rZZT0MoF.jpg"},